  "description": "Introducing the 26\" Kent Avalon, a full suspension hybrid bike that blends comfort and performance for an unparalleled ride. With a tig-welded steel suspension frame and front suspension fork, this bike is designed to absorb shocks and provide a smooth, comfortable ride on any terrain. The dual linear side pull brakes provide reliable stopping power, while the smooth hybrid street tires ensure stability and grip on both pavement and dirt. The quick height adjustable deluxe comfort saddle allows you to customize your fit and riding position, while the 7 speed drivetrain with an easy to use twist shifter gives you the ability to tackle hills and changing terrain with ease. Whether you're commuting to work or exploring your local trails, the Kent Avalon is the perfect choice for riders who demand both comfort and versatility.",
